      *> Report Writer Layer 3: CONTROLS data control breaks -> CONTROL FOOTING (subtotal SUM, minor->major)
      *> + CONTROL HEADING (major->minor); FINAL footing at TERMINATE. Write back + DISPLAY.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. P144.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT RPT ASSIGN "l3.txt" ORGANIZATION LINE SEQUENTIAL.
           SELECT RIN ASSIGN "l3.txt" ORGANIZATION LINE SEQUENTIAL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD RPT REPORT IS R.
       FD RIN.
       01 RR PIC X(24).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 GRP PIC X VALUE "A".
       01 AMT PIC 99 VALUE 0.
       01 E PIC X VALUE "N".
       REPORT SECTION.
       RD R CONTROLS ARE FINAL GRP.
       01 TYPE CONTROL HEADING GRP.
          05 LINE PLUS 1. 10 COLUMN 1 PIC X(4) VALUE "GRP=". 10 COLUMN 5 PIC X SOURCE GRP.
       01 D TYPE DETAIL.
          05 LINE PLUS 1. 10 COLUMN 3 PIC 99 SOURCE AMT.
       01 TYPE CONTROL FOOTING GRP.
          05 LINE PLUS 1. 10 COLUMN 1 PIC X(4) VALUE "SUB:". 10 COLUMN 6 PIC 99 SUM AMT.
       01 TYPE CONTROL FOOTING FINAL.
          05 LINE PLUS 1. 10 COLUMN 1 PIC X(4) VALUE "TOT:". 10 COLUMN 6 PIC 99 SUM AMT.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           OPEN OUTPUT RPT. INITIATE R.
           MOVE "A" TO GRP MOVE 10 TO AMT GENERATE D.
           MOVE "A" TO GRP MOVE 20 TO AMT GENERATE D.
           MOVE "B" TO GRP MOVE 5  TO AMT GENERATE D.
           TERMINATE R. CLOSE RPT.
           OPEN INPUT RIN.
           PERFORM UNTIL E = "Y"
              READ RIN AT END MOVE "Y" TO E NOT AT END DISPLAY "[" RR "]" END-READ
           END-PERFORM.
           CLOSE RIN. STOP RUN.
